<newsitem itemid="144711" id="root" date="1996-10-25" xml:lang="en">
<title>DENMARK: Deutsche Finance issues 500 mln dkk bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Finance issues 500 mln dkk bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Sparekassen Nordjylland on Friday.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Deutsche Bank unit Deutsche Finance NV.</p>
<p>LEAD MGR -Sparekassen Nordjylland</p>
<p>AMOUNT - 500 MLN DKK</p>
<p>MATURITY - 15 November 2002</p>
<p>COUPON-4 pct</p>
<p>GUARANTOR- Deutsche Bank AG</p>
<p>ISS PRICE- to be advised</p>
<p>ISS DATE - 15 November 1996</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
